usage: run_agent.py [-h] [--profile {v1,v3,v4}] [--resume RESUME]
                    [--instance-id INSTANCE_ID | --all-dev] [--run-id RUN_ID]
                    [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR] [--reviewer]
                    [--trajectory-dir TRAJECTORY_DIR] [--offline-check]
                    [--retrieval-mode {bm25,dense_rrf}]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --profile {v1,v3,v4}
  --resume RESUME
  --instance-id INSTANCE_ID
  --all-dev
  --run-id RUN_ID
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        Experiment output directory; defaults to runs/<run-
                        id>.
  --reviewer            Enable one independent review on the first submit
                        call.
  --trajectory-dir TRAJECTORY_DIR
                        Optional single canonical directory for review
                        trajectories.
  --offline-check       Validate selected DEV containers without a Provider
                        call.
  --retrieval-mode {bm25,dense_rrf}
                        Retrieval backend; dense_rrf requires requirements-
                        dense.txt.
